OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few light showers at first,
OL,6,Fotherwise a dry start with some
OL,7,Fbrightness in the north. Rain will
OL,8,Fspread north over the area during the
OL,9,Fmorning, heavy at times on the
OL,10,Fnorthwest coast, turning light and
OL,11,Fpatchy later. Windier later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FWet and windy at first but
OL,14,Frain turning to showers with some
OL,15,Fclear conditions too. Continuing
OL,16,Fshowery overnight with a stiff
OL,17,Fwesterly wind moving the showers
OL,18,Fthrough.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
